    "hash": "7e579c2a0eacc6aa59feb29572afd615b3473cd1ecaf6c51b735098e239e85d9",
    "summary_one_sentence": "When a bus breakdown leaves a dysfunctional troupe of elite ballerinas stranded at a remote inn run by a former dancer, they must weaponize their rigorous choreography and pointe shoes to fight off a deadly gang of mobsters.",
    "summary_short": "En route to a prestigious dance competition in Budapest, five talented yet bickering ballerinas find themselves stranded in the Hungarian countryside after their bus breaks down. Seeking shelter at the secluded Teremok Inn, they unwittingly stumble into a front for a ruthless criminal syndicate led by a former prima ballerina. After their dance instructor is murdered and they are held captive, the young women are forced to set aside their personal rivalries. Utilizing their elite athletic training, razor-bladed pointe shoes, and synchronized choreography, the troupe wages a desperate, violent battle to escape.",
    "summary_long": "A talented but fractured group of five young ballerinas—Bones, Princess, Grace, Zoe, and Chloe—travel to Hungary alongside their instructor Thorna to participate in an elite competition in Budapest. Their journey hits a major setback when an airport mix-up forces them onto a dilapidated bus that breaks down on a secluded forest road. Seeking refuge and a way to reach the city, the troupe walks to the nearby Teremok Inn, a performance art-themed establishment run by enigmatic former ballerina Devora Kasimer. Tensions erupt when Thorna witnesses Devora torturing a man, prompting a volatile gangster named Pasha to murder Thorna and force Devora to imprison the girls in the basement. As a hired cleaner is brought in to dispose of them, Bones breaks free from her bonds and mobilizes her trapped friends to fight back against their captors. Realizing their physical conditioning gives them an unexpected edge, the ballerinas modify their pointe shoes with razor blades and adapt classical dance positions into lethal combat moves. Internal rivalries fade as the girls band together to systematically eliminate waves of armed henchmen through brutal, highly coordinated attacks. Meanwhile, Devora seeks revenge against the local crime syndicate's patriarch, who was responsible for ending her own dancing career years prior. In a climactic showdown, Devora rigs the inn with explosives to destroy the mobsters while allowing the surviving ballerinas a chance to flee. Escaping the burning building just as the charges detonate, the battered troupe commandeers motorcycles and rides off toward Budapest.",
    "synopsis": "Pretty Lethal is an action-thriller following five elite ballerinas who travel to Hungary for a career-defining dance showcase in Budapest. When unexpected transport troubles leave the young women stranded along a remote forest route, they take shelter at a secluded roadside inn operated by Devora, a former prima ballerina with a dark past. Unknown to the dancers, the inn serves as a hideout for a dangerous local crime family. When an unexpected incident turns the venue into a deadly trap, the troupe is forced to unite and transform years of grueling ballet discipline, balance, and specialized footwear into a unique combat style to survive the night.",
